{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57226","headline":"谶 十五 · 菩提达摩","name":"谶 十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"走戊与朝邻，（走戊者，越字，忠国师是越州人也。\n与朝邻者，爲国师）鹅乌子出身。\n（鹅者，鹅州也，今越州是。\n乌者，鸣鹤县也，今诸暨县是，国师生此县也）二天虽有感，（二天者，肃宗、代宗二帝也。\n有感者，帝礼爲师也）三化寂无尘。\n（三化寂无尘者，二帝与国师俱寂也）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"菩提达摩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57226.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57226","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}